<section class="section actone" id="problem" aria-labelledby="actone-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="actone__grid">
      <div class="actone__lead reveal">
        <h2 class="actone__title" id="actone-title">
          Why your last upgrade didn't pay off.
        </h2>
        <p class="actone__stat ph" data-countup="30" tabindex="0">~30%</p>
        <p class="actone__stat-note">
          According to the EPA, the average commercial building wastes about a
          third of the energy it consumes. Most hotels have never had anyone
          qualified find out where.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="actone__body reveal">
        <p>
          You added lighting. Maybe controls, maybe solar. Each vendor optimized
          the one thing they sell, then left. But a hotel isn't a stack of
          separate upgrades. It's one electrical system, and when pieces get
          bolted on without anyone designing how they work together, they
          interfere. Power quality degrades, equipment runs harder and fails
          sooner, and the savings on the brochure quietly leak away.
        </p>
        <p class="actone__turn">
          That interference isn't bad luck. Every vendor in this industry gets
          paid to install their box, so each one optimizes their own piece and
          none of them owns the result. Your building wasn't left incoherent by
          accident. It was left incoherent by incentive.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .actone {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .actone__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 360px), 1fr));
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .actone__title {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    max-width: 14ch;
  }
  .actone__stat {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: var(--space-l);
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 6rem);
    line-height: 0.9;
    color: var(--gold-text);
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .actone__stat-note {
    margin-top: var(--space-s);
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--body);
    max-width: 44ch;
  }
  .actone__body {
    padding-top: var(--space-2xs);
  }
  .actone__body p {
    color: var(--body);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .actone__turn {
    margin-top: var(--space-m);
    color: var(--ink) !important;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .actone__body.reveal {
      transition-delay: 0.1s;
    }
  }
</style>
